# ---- Large raw optimization records (≈15 GB, intentionally NOT tracked) ----
# `data/raw/` holds the full per-run Results.mat files; many of them exceed
# GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit. Every published figure can still be
# regenerated from the compact `data/repro/` files that ARE tracked.
**/data/raw/

# ---- MATLAB / Python / editor scratch ----
*.asv
*.autosave
*.m~
**/figures/fig/
**/figures/from_repro_data/
**/_old_png_backup/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---- logs / backups / temp ----
*.log
*.bak
*.tmp

# ---- OS ----
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
